   "ctx": "sv-h2",
   "fig": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "Page 1 of each PDF, rendered by each stack from the same records at 110 dpi. Each row: modern before, modern after, legacy before, legacy after. All renders are new for this file; none shows an \"Attn\" line. Printed documents have no phone layout, so this page has no phone board. For the part sale with a vehicle, a 4 Star vehicle (2011 Hyundai Santa Fe, unit set to 4417) was attached to P2-256 for the render on both stacks and removed after. The document design setting was switched between modern and legacy for the renders and set back to legacy.",
   "line": 28,
   "kind": "text",
   "ctx": "",
   "fig": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "Invoice billed to someone else (INV-S2-17581, Buda billed to Valders)",
